## 🔄 Development Workflow

### Branch Strategy

```
main (production)
  ↓
release/v5.0.0 (staging)
  ↓
develop (integration)
  ↓
feature/* (development)
  ├── feature/ai-employees
  ├── feature/task-management
  ├── feature/worker-scaling
  └── feature/real-time-monitoring
```

### Commit Message Convention

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject> (#<issue>)

<body>

<footer>

Types:
  feat      New feature
  fix       Bug fix
  docs      Documentation
  style     Formatting
  refactor  Code reorganization
  test      Tests
  chore     Dependencies, CI/CD
  perf      Performance

Scope:
  agents        Agent framework
  automation    Workflow engine
  api           REST/GraphQL
  database      Schema, migrations
  web           Frontend
  commander     Orchestration
  deployment    DevOps
  docs          Documentation

Example:
feat(agents): add memory persistence for long-term context (#142)

Added LangChain integration for vector storage of agent
memories. Agents can now remember conversations across
multiple sessions.

- Integrated Pinecone for vector DB
- Added memory_persistence config
- Updated BaseAgent class
- Added tests for memory retrieval

Closes #142
```

