## ❓ What's Actually Missing (Complete Gaps Analysis)

### v5.0 — AI Employee System (Current)

#### Already Built
✅ BaseAgent framework
✅ SDR agent (basic functionality)
✅ Email tools
✅ CRM integration
✅ Task queue (basic)
✅ Database schema
✅ REST API endpoints

#### Missing (Critical Path)
🔴 **Worker Clustering**
- Need: Distributed agent execution across multiple servers
- Why: Scale to 100+ concurrent agents
- Effort: 2 weeks
- Impact: Without this, agents can't scale beyond single instance

🔴 **Advanced Memory System**
- Need: Long-term context storage & retrieval
- Current: In-memory only (lost on restart)
- Needed: Vector database + semantic search
- Why: Agents forget context after restart
- Tech: Pinecone or similar vector DB
- Effort: 1-2 weeks
- Impact: Critical for multi-turn conversations

🔴 **Real-time Monitoring Dashboard**
- Need: Live agent status, task queue, error tracking
- Current: Just database queries
- Needed: WebSocket updates, charts, alerts
- Effort: 1-2 weeks
- Impact: Operations visibility

🔴 **Worker Permission System**
- Need: Fine-grained access control for agents
- Current: All agents can use all tools
- Needed: RBAC per agent, tool-level permissions
- Effort: 1 week
- Impact: Security & compliance

🔴 **AI SDR Rewrite**
- Need: Rebuild SDR agent with new capabilities
- Current: Basic prospecting
- Needed: Multi-step sequences, context awareness, persistence
- Effort: 2-3 weeks
- Impact: Core revenue generation

🔴 **New Agents (Setter, Support, QA, Analyst)**
- Need: 4 new agent types
- Setter: Schedule meetings, handle objections
- Support: 24/7 customer support
- QA: Test products, verify quality
- Analyst: Generate reports, analyze metrics
- Effort: 3-4 weeks (1 week each)
- Impact: Core business operations

🔴 **Agent Skill Marketplace**
- Need: Library of reusable skills
- Current: Nothing
- Needed: Versioning, testing, sharing
- Effort: 2-3 weeks
- Impact: Extensibility

#### Medium Priority
