## 🏗️ How to Contribute

### Setup Development Environment

```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/jroc-os/core.git
cd jroc-os

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Setup environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit with your credentials

# Start local environment
docker-compose up -d

# Run migrations
npm run db:migrate

# Start development servers
npm run dev

# Run tests
npm run test
```

### Creating a Feature

```bash
# Create feature branch
git checkout -b feature/my-new-feature

# Make changes
# Commit with proper message format
git commit -m "feat(agents): add new agent capability"

# Push and create PR
git push origin feature/my-new-feature
# Go to GitHub and create PR

# PR will trigger CI/CD
# Tests must pass
# 2+ code reviews required
# Then merge
```

